sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Analyst
  participant B as BenchmarkPage
  participant API as /api/benchmark
  participant PY as benchmark_replay
  participant M as Artifacts
  A->>B: choose CSV
  B->>B: size check (2 MB)
  B->>API: POST csv
  API->>PY: spawn, CSV on stdin
  PY->>PY: validate (5,000 rows)
  PY->>M: verify SHA-256, load
  M-->>PY: models, thresholds
  PY-->>API: JSON results
  alt error or 120 s timeout
    API-->>B: failure kind
  else success
    API-->>B: BenchmarkSuccess
    B-->>A: metrics, row table
  end
